  "description": "A full-height cupboard in the corner, 800 along the back wall and 650 out along the left wall, with a pair of 387 doors on its end, facing the kitchen. Bench 3038, from x = 800, 330 deep. Inside, within its 18 boards (rear panels against the walls included): 764 × 614, 2407 high. Above the bench: a 75\" TV (1680 × 960), centred on the 3038 of clear wall, from 1100 to 2060. 250-deep shelves right across, 3038 long, below it at 1000 and above it at 2210. A middle shelf at 1550 either side, 529 long, 150 clear of the TV. A dresser on the front wall between the sink and the desk (x 1008-2008): 1000 wide overall (its body 960), 1930 high, 420 deep up to 830 (two drawers over two doors, under a wooden top), then 420 deep with three open shelves.From option 10 (new)"
